{
  "_id": "dcf8fb96-9cf0-4b7e-808c-02c504dcf160",
  "body": {
    "en": [
      {
        "_key": "b40hz",
        "_type": "tldrBox",
        "items": [
          "Trends come and go — **conversion stays the metric**.",
          "Safely ignore: AI gloss, scroll hijacking, mobile video backgrounds, brutalism for its own sake",
          "\"Eternal trends\" that always work: speed, readability, honest photos",
          "The trend test: **\"will this help my customer buy?\"** No — it's decoration"
        ],
        "title": "In 60 seconds"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40i0",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40i1",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Every year the \"10 web design trends\" lists arrive, and every year businesses pay to install what will read as a period diagnosis two years later. I'm a designer — I'm supposed to love trends. I love client money more. Here's what's fashionable right now that you can skip without losing a thing."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40i2",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40i3",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "What you can safely ignore"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40i6",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40i4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "AI gloss. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40i5",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Identical gradient blobs, glass cards and shimmering generated illustrations have become visual noise: sites blur into one. The irony is that the \"AI look\" now reads as \"made without a human\" — and lowers trust."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40i9",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40i7",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Scroll hijacking. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40i8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "When the page scrolls \"cinematically\" instead of the way users expect. Impressive for the first 5 seconds, irritating for the next 50. It has never lifted anyone's conversion."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ic",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40ia",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Video backgrounds on mobile. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40ib",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "They eat data and battery, drag LCP — and nobody admires them on a 6-inch screen."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40if",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40id",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Brutalism for its own sake. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40ie",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Works for galleries and fashion brands with a strong art director. For a clinic or a construction firm, \"raw\" design reads as broken, not bold."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ii",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40ig",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Custom cursors and chasers. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40ih",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Mouse trails, circle cursors… On touchscreens — most of your traffic — they simply don't exist."
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "number",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ij",
        "_type": "blogImage",
        "alt": "A moodboard with colours and materials in a design studio",
        "asset": {
          "_ref": "image-006bfea99d9d2da0bcac6f613a8905e5a3021d2c-1600x2409-jpg",
          "_type": "reference"
        },
        "caption": "A moodboard is useful when it answers to the audience, not the Behance feed"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ik",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40il",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "\"Trends\" that are actually permanent principles"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40io",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40im",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Speed. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40in",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Mattered ten years ago, matters today. No trend is worth +2 seconds of loading."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ir",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40ip",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Readability. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40iq",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Big text, honest contrast, air. The small-grey-font fashion comes and goes — reading is forever."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40iu",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40is",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "strong"
            ],
            "text": "Honest photos and numbers. "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40it",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A real team, real work, real results. This \"trends\" exactly as long as trust exists."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40iv",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40iw",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "A simple test for any trend"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40ix",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40iy",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Ask: \"will this help my customer understand the offer faster and buy?\" If yes — it's not a trend, it's a tool; take it. If the answer is \"well, it looks modern\" — it's decoration at your expense. What makes a site modern isn't the year of its tricks but whether it solves the job faster than competitors."
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40iz",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j0",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "When design genuinely needs a refresh"
          }
        ],
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "h2"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40j1",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j2",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Conversion falls on stable traffic — the site stopped persuading"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40j3",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j4",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "Positioning or audience changed — the design talks to the wrong people"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40j5",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j6",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The mobile version was squeezed, not designed"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40j7",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j8",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "The site is 5+ years old and slower than competitors"
          }
        ],
        "level": 1,
        "listItem": "bullet",
        "markDefs": [],
        "style": "normal"
      },
      {
        "_key": "b40jg",
        "_type": "block",
        "children": [
          {
            "_key": "b40j9",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "How we approach design that sells — in our breakdowns of "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40jb",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "b40ja"
            ],
            "text": "9 conversion moves"
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40jc",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": " and "
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40je",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [
              "b40jd"
            ],
            "text": "safe redesigns"
          },
          {
            "_key": "b40jf",
            "_type": "span",
            "marks": [],
            "text": "."
          }
